OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSomewhat
OL,6,Fcloudy at first across Shetland but
OL,7,Fmainly dry with just the odd light
OL,8,Fshower possible. Bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells in Orkney. Staying mostly dry
OL,10,Fovernight with some clear spells
OL,11,Fdeveloping. Fresh west to northwest
OL,12,Fwinds for Shetland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FBright or sunny spells with a
OL,15,Ffew showers around in the morning,
OL,16,Fbecoming largely dry through the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Fresh westerly winds for
OL,18,FShetland at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
